# build/nwp-solo.include — the ALLOWLIST for the `nwp-solo` build target (ops#27).
#
# nwp-solo = the SINGLE-MACHINE, AI-FREE ENTRY TIER: one box, no AI, no fleet, no
# SaaS. A strict SUPERSET of the nwp-server (prod-agent) set plus the local
# lifecycle verbs a one-box operator needs. Same build-time guarantee: assembled
# from this allowlist, then scanned fail-closed against build/nwp-server.deny-symbols
# (shared). Build with:  pl build-server --target nwp-solo
#
# SCAFFOLD STATE (2026-07-18): the prod-agent base + `restore` are included and
# deny-clean. `install`/`backup` are TODO — they pull in SaaS/token clients
# (Linode DNS in lib/install-common.sh; the GitLab API client in lib/git.sh) that
# must be split out first (ops#27 follow-up) and need a full install/backup test.
#
# ── prod-agent base (mirrors build/nwp-server.include) ──────────────────────
bin/nwp-server

# ── config resolution (read nwp.yml; reach prod over ssh) ───────────────────
lib/ui.sh
lib/common.sh
lib/project-resolver.sh
lib/server-resolver.sh
lib/ssh.sh

# ── pull + verify (signature + payload integrity) ───────────────────────────
lib/minisign.sh
lib/bundle-hash.sh
lib/bundle-verify.sh
scripts/commands/server-pull.sh

# ── apply + rollback (deploy a verified bundle; roll back = re-apply previous) ─
lib/rollback.sh
lib/rollback-remote.sh
scripts/commands/rollback.sh
scripts/commands/server-apply.sh

# ── local status (JSON; no SaaS, no outbound network) ───────────────────────
scripts/commands/server-status.sh

# ── snapshot → sanitize → fail-closed PII gate → publish (write-only token) ──
# The prod publish verb is scripts/commands/server-publish.sh. The build-tier
# scripts/commands/publish.sh (registry uploader needing a full-api PAT) is
# DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED — it must never reach a prod host (ADR-0026 ledger).
lib/pii-gate.sh
lib/sanitizers/
scripts/commands/server-publish.sh

# ── backup (DR: raw restic snapshot to ver, custodian-pull) — ADR-0025 ───────
scripts/commands/server-backup.sh
scripts/commands/ver-backup-pull.sh

# ── nwp-solo additions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# restore: recover a site from a backup (deny-clean after the ops#27 comment
# rewords). NOTE: full functional restore also needs its lib deps
# (database-router, pair, …) — tracked with install/backup below.
scripts/commands/restore.sh

# ── TODO (ops#27 follow-up — DO NOT ADD until split + tested) ────────────────
# scripts/commands/install.sh      # needs Linode DNS client split out of install-common.sh
# scripts/commands/backup.sh       # needs GitLab API client split out of lib/git.sh backup path
